    /// Storage: `IntentSettlement::MinSignerThreshold` (r:1 w:0)
    /// Proof: `IntentSettlement::MinSignerThreshold` (`max_values`: Some(1), `max_size`: Some(4), added: 499, mode: `MaxEncodedLen`)
